 !                                                                              
  
 ! This test uses the Levy-Leblond method to calculate properties in the        
  
 ! non-relativistic limit. We take H2 as a test case with inversion symmetry.   
  
 ! Note that the answer will deviate slightly from the DALTON answer because    
  
 ! g = 2 in this formulation.                                                   
  
 !                                                                              
  
 **DIRAC                                                                        
  
 .TITLE                                                                         
  
 Water molecule. Levy-Leblond calculation. Spin-spin couplings                  
  
 .WAVE F                                                                        
  
 .PROPER                                                                        
  
 **HAMILTONIAN                                                                  
  
 .LEVY-LEBLOND                                                                  
  
 **WAVE FUNCTIONS                                                               
  
 .DHF                                                                           
  
 **PROPERTIES                                                                   
  
 #.SPIN-SPIN                                                                    
  
 #.DSO                                                                          
  
 .NMR                                                                           
  
 *LINEAR RESPONSE                                                               
  
 .PRINT                                                                         
  
 1                                                                              
  
 *END OF                                                                        
  
                                                                                
  


